      "query": "{\"content\": \"# Forecast: RNC v. Eakin (25-962), disposition after CVSG\\n\\n**Bottom line: the Court grants certiorari, most likely in the first half of\\nOT2026, and sets the case for argument (probably consolidated with\\nPennsylvania v. Eakin, No. 25-967).**\\n\\n## What happens from here\\n\\n- **Relists.** The docket shows two distributions (conferences of 4/17/2026 and\\n  6/25/2026), after which the Court called for the views of the Solicitor\\n  General rather than acting. The petition will be **d",
